guide forever/professions/fishing
title Fishing 1-300
category Professions
coords era
levels 1-60
zone Azeroth

# Fishing catches fish from any lake, river or coast; Cooking turns them into food. Every catch below
# skill 75 gives a point; from there, fewer do, and harder water lets fish get away below its skill
# unless a lure on the pole makes up the gap.
#
# Ranks: Apprentice at any level and Journeyman from skill 50 and level 10, at the fishing trainers by
# the water near every starting area and in every capital. Expert comes from the book Expert Fishing -
# The Bass and You (skill 125, level 20), sold by Old Man Heming in Booty Bay. Artisan comes from Nat
# Pagle in Dustwallow Marsh after his quest (skill 225, level 35).
#
# Shiny Baubles (+25), Nightcrawlers (+50) and Bright Baubles (+75) are lures: each adds to your
# Fishing skill for ten minutes.
#
# Each gathering step offers farming loops through the densest ground of what the skill can gather
# (the server's own spawns, how often each is up, and what players' recorded gathers gave): the arrow
# takes the one that gets you there soonest from where you are, never among creatures two or more
# levels above you, and away from the other faction's towns and guards. Waypoints are Era-frame; a map
# without one (Zephras Isle) compiles live.

section Fishing 1-75

step Learn Fishing
  tip No character level needed.
  train Fishing Apprentice

step Buy a Fishing Pole
  tip Equipped like a weapon while you fish.
  buy 6256 x1 nearest

step Buy 2 Shiny Baubles
  tip A lure: +25 Fishing for ten minutes, so fewer fish get away.
  buy 6529 x2 nearest

step Equip the Fishing Pole
  tip Fishing needs the pole in your hands; your weapon goes back on after.
  equip 6256

step Put a Shiny Bauble on the pole
  tip It lasts ten minutes.
  use 6529 anywhere

step Fish near your starting area until 75
  tip The bobber splashes when a fish bites; a right-click on it lands the catch. Every catch gives a point.
